  "2026-08-03T11:09:25.972Z","harness:codex","Estimate basis 2026-08-03: 900 minutes reflects a cross-call budget ledger, served-fact references, deterministic degradation, session and fleet composition, CI ratchet, and small-workspace no-regression proof."
  "2026-08-03T11:15:45.320Z","harness:codex","Sequencing 2026-08-03: establish trustworthy per-command ceilings in pm-5t33or before composing a session ledger, then use the same receipt and degradation algebra for within-session deduplication. This item implements the agent-facing simplification outcome because fewer commands are insufficient if the prescribed multi-call orientation still repeats a third of its bytes."
